<section class="section" aria-labelledby="living-title">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 id="living-title">Living here</h2>
    {# TODO: draft copy, drawn from the old About page. #}
    <p>The neighborhood dates back to the 1800s and is rich in architectural history. It's one of the city's fastest growing urban neighborhoods, and still a quiet one: under a thousand residents in fewer than four hundred households, where people know the names of the folks on their block.</p>
    <p>Neighbors meet on the last Monday of each month, and the association organizes clean-ups, block parties, and get-togethers through the year. <a href="/get-involved/">Everyone is welcome to take part</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

